LICENSE NOTE

This folder (DDC_in_additon/) contains additional assets for the
cad2data-Revit-IFC-DWG repository (documentation, images, sample
helpers). It does not contain converter binaries.

The licensing terms of this repository are set out in:
  - ../LICENSE                  (MIT License, for the open parts)
  - ../LICENSE-PROPRIETARY      (DDC Proprietary Software License,
                                 for the DDC binaries)
  - ../NOTICE                   (which component falls under which
                                 license, and attributions)

Third-party components of the DDC release packages are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES inside each release package.
